<title>USA: Alltel Corp Q4 shr $0.51 vs $0.48.</title>
<headline>Alltel Corp Q4 shr $0.51 vs $0.48.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, ARK. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		     $  $0.51		  $  0.48</p>
<p> Net			 96,932		   92,577</p>
<p> Revs		     806,301		  773,855</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 189,646		  190,349</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr		     $   1.53		  $  1.86</p>
<p> Net			291,737		  354,616</p>
<p> Revs		   3,192,418		3,109,725</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 190,370		  190,072</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call Mean Estimate for Q4 was $0.51 per share.</p>
<p>First Call Mean Estimate for Year was $1.91 per share.</p>
<p>NOTE: As reported in previous quarters, the company recorded one-time adjustments totaling approximately $74,197,000 after tax, reducing 1996 earnings per share by 39 cents while the 1995 results include a one-time gain of $19,849,000 million or 10 cents per share.</p>
<p>Including the one-time adjustments in both periods, net income for 1996 was $291,737,000 compared with $354,616,000 in the year-ago period, while earnings per share amounted to $1.53 compared with $1.86 cents in the prior-year period.</p>
</text>
